        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 801AT, Amherst Double Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nKwikset's Double Cylinder Amherst handleset is both elegant and timeless. What is best about this handle set is that the decorative grip will never go out of style; a simple classic, it will look beautiful for years. A double cylinder is operated by key outside and key inside. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Double Cylinder Handleset:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on both the inside and outside; and the latchbolt is operated by a turnknob inside and a thumbpiece outside. In order to increase security, double cylinder handlesets are usually used on front or back doors where there is a window in close proximity to the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: <br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/amherst-single-cylinder-handleset-kwikset-800at\"><b>Amherst Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/amherst-dummy-cylinder-handleset-kwikset-802at\"><b>Amherst Dummy Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Features</b> for the Amherst Double Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.5 Grade 1 Deadbolt</li>\r\n<li> SmartKey cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>Bump-resistant deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pry shield.</li>\r\n<li> Polymer coating.</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass with solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 801AT Amherst Door Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<!-- <li>Finish: <b>Satin Nickel</b></li> -->\r\n<li>Exterior Length Overall: 18-23/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt to Latch Spacing:  5-1/2\" center to center</li>\r\n<li>Center of Latch to Center of Throughbolt:  8-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Cross Bore: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" doors.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The double cylinder has a thumbpiece on the outside and a turnknob on the inside. The deadbolt is key operated on both the inside and the outside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><i>The inside trim finish will match the exterior handleset finish that you choose.</i></p>",
